message: "If you use SPADE, cite the archived software release and accompanying paper."
title: "SPADE: certifying operating regions for cell-manufacturing experiments under fixed well budgets"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
authors:
  - family-names: Yung
    given-names: Joseph
  - family-names: Kwan
    given-names: Alana
repository-code: "https://github.com/akwnn/nutrigene-ai-bo-ipsec"
