abstract: >-
  SPADE is a sequential design and conservative-set certification workflow for
  cell-manufacturing experiments, evaluated against Bayesian optimization,
  classical design of experiments, and one-shot designs.
keywords:
  - Bayesian optimization
  - design of experiments
  - cell manufacturing
  - Gaussian process
  - operating region
